docs+script: acceptance checklist and a runnable five-act demo

- docs/验收.md: capability matrix, measured numbers (throughput per backend,
  isolation and --jobs, coverage report, determinism), the two metric lessons,
  known limitations, code size
- script/demo.ps1 and script/demo.sh: tests, a real finding, replay/minimize,
  crash isolation, coverage report and corpus persistence in ~30 seconds
- README links the acceptance doc